.TH HD-THEME-CARD 1 "October 2026" "hd-theme" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-theme-card \- render a HyprDebian theme into a card
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hd-theme-card
.I theme.json card.png
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hd-theme-card
renders the theme in
.I theme.json
into
.IR card.png :
its colours and their roles, the font at its three sizes, icons, the
geometry of a corner with its border and radius, and windows, a menu and
workspaces as they look in the theme, on its background.
.PP
The theme file is a theme as described in
.BR hd-theme (7),
or a configuration with the key
.BR hd-theme ,
such as
.IR /etc/hyprdebian/config.json .
The name of the theme is its member
.BR name ,
else the name of the file without
.IR .json .
The background is the image of its family that fits a screen of 1920x1080.
.PP
.BR hd-theme (1)
renders the card of every theme to
.IR /var/cache/hd-theme/cards/<name>.png .
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
hd-theme-card /etc/hyprdebian/config.json card.png
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-theme (7),
.BR hd-theme (1)
